  "details": "The idea would be a detail texture slot for emissions. This would function similar to the detail texture slot, except that the combined result of the main and detail emission textures would be what the emissions appear as. You could use different blend modes, just like the detail slot, which would allow for some really cool effects, like emissions animated emissions that stack additively when overlapping, CRT screen effects, as well as acting as a mask for details in the emissions (skin details, fur, clothing, etc)",
